.TH "PACE CACHE" "1" "2026-05-17" "0.1.0" "pace cache Manual"
.SH NAME
pace\-cache \- Manage the local response cache.
.SH SYNOPSIS
.B pace cache
[OPTIONS] COMMAND [ARGS]...
.SH DESCRIPTION
Manage the local response cache.
.SH COMMANDS
.PP
\fBstats\fP
  Show cache entries and size.
  See \fBpace cache-stats(1)\fP for full documentation on the \fBstats\fP command.
.PP
\fBclear\fP
  Delete all cached responses.
  See \fBpace cache-clear(1)\fP for full documentation on the \fBclear\fP command.
.PP
\fBpath\fP
  Print the cache database path.
  See \fBpace cache-path(1)\fP for full documentation on the \fBpath\fP command.
